            "category_key": "shipping",
            "question": "Are YAZ & Co products insured when shipped?",
            "answer": "<p>YAZ & Co remains responsible for<br/>orders until the package is confirmed as delivered to the customer. If an issue<br/>occurs during shipment, our team may coordinate with the courier provider to<br/>review the case. Once delivery has been confirmed by the courier,<br/>responsibility transfers to the customer in accordance with our Terms &<br/>Conditions.</p><p>For assistance, please contact the YAZ<br/>& Co team through our official communication channels.</p>"
          }
        },
