            "question": "How can I return or exchange an online exclusive item?",
            "answer": "<p>Online purchases follow the same YAZ<br/>& Co return policy and are subject to approval based on the conditions<br/>outlined in our Terms & Conditions.</p><p>Returns may only be considered for:</p><ul><li>Proven manufacturing defects </li><li>Incorrect items delivered </li><li>Items not matching agreed specifications </li></ul><p>Products must be returned unused, in<br/>original condition, and accompanied by the original invoice, packaging, and<br/>certificates where applicable.</p><p>Custom-made, engraved, or personalized<br/>items are not eligible for return or exchange.</p>"
